      "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:30:17.287Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello Team,</p>\n<p>We need some guidance regarding <strong>GSTR-9</strong> in ERPNext.</p>\n<p>Currently, we are not able to find a standard option or report for generating <strong>GSTR-9</strong> (Annual Return) under India Compliance. Kindly let us know:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Is <strong>GSTR-9</strong> supported out of the box in ERPNext India Compliance?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If not, is there any recommended workaround or custom script/report that can be used?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Are there any upcoming updates planned for including GSTR-9?</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Any help, documentation links, or guidance would be highly appreciated.</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>\n<p>Regards,</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/a9adbd/{size}.png",
