      "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:34:07.835Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>GSTR-9 is not supported out of the box in ERPNext India Compliance.</p>\n<p>You can use helper reports like GST Purchase Register Beta, GST Sales Register Beta, GST Account-wise Summary, GST Tax Rate-wise Summary, etc., to consolidate GSTR-9 data.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aaa593562d33b66422a31243487c4d860f2ab92a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/aaa593562d33b66422a31243487c4d860f2ab92a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aaa593562d33b66422a31243487c4d860f2ab92a_2_690x435.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"olBUF71aCxY0OQIfj87PjhBxMgy\" width=\"690\" height=\"435\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aaa593562d33b66422a31243487c4d860f2ab92a_2_690x435.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aaa593562d33b66422a31243487c4d860f2ab92a.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aaa593562d33b66422a31243487c4d860f2ab92a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1C1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1028×649 69.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
